    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d4">

                <pb facs="0009" n="3" sameAs="frus:frus1939v05/pg3"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">810.24/34: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Uruguay</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Dwyre</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Montevideo</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1939-06-28T15:00:00-03:30">June 28, 1939—3
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received 3:40 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>46. Referring to Department’s circular telegram dated June 27, 7 p.m., I called
                    on the Minister for Foreign Affairs at 1 p.m. today and handed him an informal
                    memorandum in the sense of the Department’s instruction. The Minister read it in
                    my presence, inquired as to one or two points, thanked me for presenting the
                    matter for his consideration and stated that he would study it, discuss the
                    subject with other members of the government and would give me a statement in a
                    few days, stating that he observed that such statement would be for the
                    confidential information of the Congressional Committees. I expressed
                    appreciation and said that I would be glad to telegraph the Department
                    immediately upon receipt of his expression of opinion.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Dwyre</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
